# long input method commits (lib/ui/ctx.rs: the text queue, plat::ime_commit_text): a commit
# longer than a pass took before (64 characters) arrives whole and in order (emoji, a ZWJ
# sequence, e + combining acute, CJK), 1000 characters in one commit, and as much through a
# tool window that hands the text on to its owner (win.rs uiw_fwd_take)
size 1000 3000
theme light
click #7961
expect #7961 focused
key ctrl+a
key delete
expect #7961 text ""
commit "Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc " 5
expect #7961 text "Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc "
expect #7961 value 220
key ctrl+a
key delete
commit "abcdefghi " 100
expect #7961 value 1000
# a tool window whose slider has the focus borrows the keys: the text goes on to the main
# window's box
click "Werkzeugfenster"
expect window 7600 open
click #7961
key ctrl+a
key delete
click #7601
expect window 7600 keys
commit "Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc " 5
expect #7961 text "Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc Grüße aus 東京 🙂 é 👩‍💻 abc "
expect #7601 value 51
expect_nowarn
